nodes.goal:
Classify every item in your Inputs (intake's roster) against the owner's standing rule, applied verbatim:
{run.decision_rule}
Three buckets only. urgent = the rule clearly demands a human now; routine = the rule clearly covers ordinary handling; ambiguous = the rule does not clearly cover it - NEVER force such an item into another bucket. Each entry names the item id and the rule clause or evidence that drove it. Reply with ONLY fenced json {"urgent": [{"id": "..", "reason": "<rule clause>"}], "routine": ["<id>"], "ambiguous": [{"id": "..", "why": "<what the rule does not cover>"}]}
